941 F and G savings bonds for 3-1/4% marketable bonds of 1978-83.\\n6/ Includes exchanges of Series 1948 F and G bonds for 4-3/4% marketable notes of 1964.\\n7/ Includes exchanges of Series 1949 F and G bonds for 4% marketable bonds of 1969.\\n8/ Includes exchanges of Series 1950 F and G bonds for 3-7/8% marketable bonds of 1968.\\n9/ Includes exchanges of Series 1951 and 1952 F and G bonds for 3-7/8% marketable bonds of 1971 and 4% marketable bonds of 1980.\\n10/ Represents changes in the amounts of redemptions not yet classified between matured and unmatured issues.\\n* Less than $500,000.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [55, 78, 91, 111], \"page_id\": 78}], \"content\": \"64\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1319, 73, 1587, 116], \"page_id\": 78}], \"content\": \"Treasury Bulletin\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [614, 151, 1047, 174], \"page_id\": 78}], \"content\": \"OWNERSHIP OF FEDERAL SECURITIES\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [184, 217, 1496, 259], \"page_id\": 78}], \"content\": \"Table 1.- Distribution of Federal Securities by Classes of Investors and Types of Issues\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [707, 259, 941, 285], \"page_id\": 78}], \"content\": \"(In millions of dollars)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [59, 292, 1596, 997], \"page_id\": 78}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th rowspan=\\\"2\\\">End of fiscal year or month</th><th rowspan=\\\"2\\\">Total Federal securities outstanding 1/</th><th colspan=\\\"6\\\">Interest-earning securities issued by the U.S. Government</th><th colspan=\\\"3\\\">Interest-earning securities guaranteed by the U.S. Government 4/</th><th rowspan=\\\"2\\\">Matured debt and debt bearing no interest</