ue by the respective exchange rates. Then I'll do the same for 1965-1966 to get the comparative ratios. This will help me understand the absolute difference between these two ratios.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_c7207ce8e1ffc2b1","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://www.quandl.com/api/v3/datasets/WORLDBANK/IND_PA_NUS_FCRF?format=json\" 2>/dev/null | head -30"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
